<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand-col">
      <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="CanLead – strona główna">
        <img class="logo-image" src="/logo.svg" alt="CanLead" width="140" height="46" />
      </a>
      <p>Biuro rachunkowe dla firm, które cenią spokój i terminowość. Księgowość, kadry i doradztwo w jednym miejscu.</p>
      <div class="socials">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100064389210272" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social" aria-label="CanLead na Facebooku" title="CanLead na Facebooku">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.07C24 5.41 18.63 0 12 0S0 5.4 0 12.07C0 18.1 4.39 23.1 10.13 24v-8.44H7.08v-3.49h3.04V9.41c0-3.02 1.8-4.7 4.54-4.7 1.31 0 2.68.24 2.68.24v2.97h-1.5c-1.5 0-1.96.93-1.96 1.89v2.26h3.33l-.53 3.49h-2.8V24C19.62 23.1 24 18.1 24 12.07"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="link-col">
      <div class="col-title">Usługi</div>
      <a href="/#uslugi">Księgowość</a>
      <a href="/#uslugi">Kadry i płace</a>
      <a href="/#uslugi">Doradztwo podatkowe</a>
      <a href="/#uslugi">Zakładanie firmy</a>
    </div>
    <div class="link-col">
      <div class="col-title">Firma</div>
      <a href="/#o-nas">O nas</a>
      <a href="/#cennik">Cennik</a>
      <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
      <a href="/#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
    </div>
    <div class="link-col">
      <div class="col-title">Kontakt</div>
      <span>+48 734 184 042</span>
      <span>biuro@canlead.pl</span>
      <span>ul. Grunwaldzka 12B, 99-300 Kutno</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bottom">
    <span>© 2026 CanLead · NIP 7752645944</span>
    <div class="legal-links">
      <a href="/polityka-prywatnosci">Polityka prywatności</a>
      <a href="/regulamin">Regulamin</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { background: oklch(0.22 0.02 256); padding: 64px 64px 32px; }

  .container {
    max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .logo-image {
    display: block;
    height: 46px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .logo:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .brand-col p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: oklch(0.7 0.015 256); margin-top: 18px; max-width: 300px; }

  /* Ikony social mediów */
  .socials { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .social {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.16);
    color: oklch(0.78 0.015 256);
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .social:hover { background: #1877f2; border-color: #1877f2; color: #fff; transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .link-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }

  .col-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 5px; }

  .link-col a, .link-col span { font-size: 14.5px; color: oklch(0.7 0.015 256); line-height: 1.5; }

  .link-col a { transition: color 0.2s; }
  .link-col a:hover { color: #fff; }

  .bottom {
    max-width: 1180px; margin: 48px auto 0;
    padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid oklch(0.3 0.02 256);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13.5px; color: oklch(0.6 0.015 256);
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
  }

  .legal-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
  .legal-links a { color: inherit; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .legal-links a:hover { color: #fff; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    footer { padding: 48px 20px 24px; }

    .container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .brand-col {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .brand-col p { max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; }

    .bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }
</style>